# Moxa ioLogik E1262.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioLogik E1262 Remote Ethernet I/O — 8-channel Thermocouple
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E1200 Series User Manual V16.2, August 2025 (Appendix A)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP (port 502); Modbus/TCP ID default = 1
# | 
# | TC channels (ch0-7):
# | FC04 addr 2048-2063 (2 words/ch, len 16): TC_multipliedEngineeringValue hi/lo
# | (unit: 0.1 °C/°F or 0.0001 mV, R)
# | FC04 addr 2064-2079 (2 words/ch, len 16): TC_scaledValue hi/lo (u32, R)
# | FC04 addr 2080-2095 (2 words/ch, len 16): TC_multipliedEngineeringValueMin hi/lo (R)
# | FC04 addr 2096-2111 (2 words/ch, len 16): TC_multipliedEngineeringValueMax hi/lo (R)
# | FC04 addr 2112-2127 (2 words/ch, len 16): TC_scaledValueMin hi/lo (u32, R)
# | FC04 addr 2128-2143 (2 words/ch, len 16): TC_scaledValueMax hi/lo (u32, R)
# | FC01 addr 4177-4184 (len 8): TC_resetMinValue ch0-7 (1=reset min; R/W)
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E1262
@description=8-TC remote Ethernet I/O, Modbus/TCP. FC04: TC_multipliedEngineeringValue unit 0.1°C/°F or 0.0001mV hi/lo (addr 2048-2063), TC_scaledValue u32 hi/lo (2064-2079), TC_multipliedEngineeringValueMin hi/lo (2080-2095), TC_multipliedEngineeringValueMax hi/lo (2096-2111), TC_scaledValueMin (2112-2127), TC_scaledValueMax (2128-2143). FC01: TC_resetMinValue (4177-4184), TC_resetMaxValue (4185-4192), TC_CJC calibration start (4193-4200). FC03: TC_refEngValue float ch0-3 (addr 2144-2151), modelName (addr 5000, 10 words, R/W — NOTE: FC03 not FC04 for E1262).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iologik-e1262.toml; Source: ioLogik E1200 Series User Manual V16.2, August 2025 (Appendix A). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
